<style>
  .community-header {
    font-size: 37px;
    max-width: 753px;
    line-height: 44px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }
  .community-grid {
    max-width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: min-content;
    column-gap: 20px;
    row-gap: 92px;
  }
  .community-cell {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: top;
    grid-column: span 1;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .community-cell .number {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .community-cell img {
    display: block; 
    width: 100%;
  }
  .community-cell p {
    display: block;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 4px 0 10px 0;
    max-width: 320px;
    line-height: 19px;
    min-height: 150px;
  }
  .community-cell a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .community-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: min-content;
    }
    .community-header {
        font-size: 27px;
        max-width: 753px;
        line-height: 33px;
        padding-bottom: 100px;
    }
  }
  
</style>

{% include "loading" %}

<div class="page-padding">

  <h1 class="page-title">Community Appreciation 04</h1>

  <div class="community-header">
    A collection of images of how people wear and interact with Adsum out in the world, and a tribute to the people who support us.
  </div>
  
  <div class="community-grid">
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">1</div>
      <p>
        We could have called this a <a href="https://www.instagram.com/popgeon" target="_blank">@popgeon</a> appreciation post. He's got 1-of-1 pieces, old gear, new gear, and sometimes wears matching Adsum Vans with his girlfriend; which feels like a hallmark of a good relationship. Here he is doubling up on Adsum with last FW's Multi Stripe Beanie and the Camp Hero Vest.</p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/410642702_18010136549121545_4440126725767482094_n.jpg?v=1707151954" alt="pop">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">2</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dubzysdojo" target="_blank">@dubzysdojo</a> recently went to Buffalo to watch the Bills lose and test our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/collections/alpine-jackets" target="_blank">Alpine Jacket</a> in one of the few remaining places to get actual winter conditions. It passed the test.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_23602.jpg?v=1707149126" alt="">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">3</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/aaronplevine/?hl=en" target="_blank">@aaronplevine</a> is well known in the fashion industry for good reason. Super talented, knows what he likes, and is extremely nice & funny to boot. Here he is doing one of his always on point fit checks with our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/marsu-jacket-black-1" target="_blank">Marsu Jacket</a>.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_23608.jpg?v=1707151037" alt="kawakiiiiii" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">4</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/superbillah" target="_blank">@superbillah</a> grabbed some drinks with some well dressed friends and caught <a href="https://www.instagram.com/mikesallabank" target="_blank">@mikesallabank</a> wearing an Engravers Hat.</p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_23606.jpg?v=1707151037" alt="superbillah" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">5</div>
      <p>
        Our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/search?type=product&q=bank+pant" target="_blank">Bank Pants</a> made it into <a href="https://www.instagram.com/guapsayeed" target="_blank">@guapsayeed</a> top 5. High honors.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_236010.jpg?v=1707151037" alt="Arco Maher" />
         </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">6</div>
       <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/_fuji__" target="_blank">@_fuji__</a> took our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/collections/alpine-jackets" target="_blank">Alpine Jacket</a> out in a Japanese snowfall. It and the jacket look real nice.
      </p>  
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_2360.jpg?v=1707149126" alt="kjooonh" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">7</div>
       <p>
       <a href="https://www.instagram.com/nick.massarelli/" target="_blank">@nick.massarelli</a> got crafty with our <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/search?type=product&q=caliper+jacket" target="_blank">Caliper Jacket</a> during Halloween. Clever lad.</p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_23605.jpg?v=1707151036" alt="nationfc" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">8</div>
      <p>
        Patina pics might be our favorites. We love to know you're getting heavy wears out of our gear. Here <a href="https://www.instagram.com/col.lisional/" target="_blank">col.lisional</a> had to buy a new pair of <a href="https://adsumnyc.com/products/adsum-reebok-club-c-mid-ii?_pos=1&_sid=0e3df947a&_ss=r" target="_blank">our chocolate Reebok's</a> to replace his well worn ones. 
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_23603.jpg?v=1707151037" alt="george__thr" />
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">9</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/alexcjorgensen/" target="_blank">@alexcjorgensen</a> in a cool doorway wearing our Fleece Crewneck from a couple seasons ago.
      </p>
       <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/IMG_23604.jpg?v=1707151037" alt="calebflowers_" />
    </div>

  </div>
  
</div>
  
